# generated app icon for the mac bundle. The .ico IS committed because the
# Windows release workflow reads it straight from the checkout; the .icns is
# rendered by packaging/build_mac_app.sh on the machine doing the build, and
# neither renderer is byte-reproducible — committing it would be pure churn.
assets/dictate.icns

